# Local working notes and the local board. Deliberately untracked: the resume
# notebook and the dashboard are for this machine, and CHANGELOG.md is the
# record that survives. Keep it that way.
docs/CONTEXT.md
docs/status.html

# Never in the tree, per CLAUDE.md's hygiene rules.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
lab-evidence/

# Exception, and it must stay a narrow one: the golden fixture for the AD SID
# security extension. Its whole value is that the bytes come from a real
# ADCS-issued certificate, so the certificate has to be tracked or the pin
# means nothing. It is a public certificate from a synthetic, disposable lab
# forest, with no key material and no real-forest data. Nothing else under
# testdata/ is exempt.
!internal/encoding/testdata/adcs-user-cert.pem

# Built binary
/spiffe-ad-broker
